{"parentUuid":"84d843d8-077d-4f33-96e0-55782b3c8ae2","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"2eb72196-1181-458f-823e-509b39a986c1","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Mgba1iBxPpcRLxcbxPrFVd","type":"tool_result","content":"on it wherever it lives.\n\n**Rules, one server at a time.** Workflows, Constraints, Capabilities,\nEngine and Settings belong to the server you pick. A rules page never mixes\ntwo servers, because each server's rules shape only its own jobs, and a sum\nof two rule sets means nothing.\n\n## What a server holds\n\nEach server is a control plane of its own, and everything that shapes it\nlives with it.\n\n- **Workspaces:** the repositories it works in, each with its checks, its\n  setup, its VM image, and what happens to a job's branch at the end.\n- **Workflows:** its series of steps, each step with its settings.\n- **Capabilities and constraints:** what an agent may call, each grant ask\n  or allowed, and the rules its work must keep, each from told to enforced.\n  Both apply to every step of a kind, or to one workflow step.\n- **Settings:** its model providers, its people and their roles, its\n  notifications, and its secrets.\n- **Records:** its jobs, its audit log, its evals, its costs, and what\n  landed.\n81:| D52 | A server's MCP servers reach a turn through `workers/bastion-mcp`, wh","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"90c8e299-ffbb-4455-a1ca-a8e72badbe12","timestamp":"2026-11-12T16:09:43.794Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"on it wherever it lives.\n\n**Rules, one server at a time.** Workflows, Constraints, Capabilities,\nEngine and Settings belong to the server you pick. A rules page never mixes\ntwo servers, because each server's rules shape only its own jobs, and a sum\nof two rule sets means nothing.\n\n## What a server holds\n\nEach server is a control plane of its own, and everything that shapes it\nlives with it.\n\n- **Workspaces:** the repositories it works in, each with its checks, its\n  setup, its VM image, and what happens to a job's branch at the end.\n- **Workflows:** its series of steps, each step with its settings.\n- **Capabilities and constraints:** what an agent may call, each grant ask\n  or allowed, and the rules its work must keep, each from told to enforced.\n  Both apply to every step of a kind, or to one workflow step.\n- **Settings:** its model providers, its people and their roles, its\n  notifications, and its secrets.\n- **Records:** its jobs, its audit log, its evals, its costs, and what\n  landed.\n81:| D52 | A server's MCP servers reach a turn through `workers/bastion-mcp`, wh","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"f739bcf5-b052-4c54-af4f-1ac501ef2344","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion","root":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion","branch":"main","default_branch":"main","status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":1,"modified":4,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":null,"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[],"visibility_cache":[]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion","platform":"macos"}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"84d843d8-077d-4f33-96e0-55782b3c8ae2","session_id":"4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion","sessionId":"4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e","version":"2.1.285","gitBranch":"main","slug":"parsed-tinkering-blum"}
