{"parentUuid":"154e8477-69e4-4241-b6bf-882bdfdfa6b7","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgyKobQtXJRmAo6yDUBGP","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01D5QAzCZRi77eHqzWwowAK5","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python3 - <<'EOF'\ndef edit(p, pairs):\n    s=open(p).read()\n    for old,new in pairs:\n        assert s.count(old)==1, (p, old[:70])\n        s=s.replace(old,new)\n    open(p,'w').write(s)\nedit('VISION.md',[\n('''**Rules, one server at a time.** Workflows, Constraints, Capabilities,\nEngine and Settings belong to the server you pick. A rules page never mixes\ntwo servers, because each server's rules shape only its own jobs, and a sum\nof two rule sets means nothing.''','''**Rules, one server at a time.** Workflows, Engine and Settings belong to\nthe server you pick. A step's rules live on the Workflows page, with the\nstep, and what applies at every step shows there when no step is picked. A\nrules page never mixes two servers, because each server's rules shape only\nits own jobs, and a sum of two rule sets means nothing.'''),\n('''- **Capabilities and constraints:** what an agent may call, each grant ask\n  or allowed, and the rules its work must keep, each from told to enforced.\n  Both apply to every step of a kind, or to one workflow step.''','''- **Rules, by layer:** the charter each workspace's repository brings; the\n  harness, what an agent may call and the rules and hooks on those calls;\n  and the factory, the checks on the work and the reviewers that must pass.\n  Each grant is ask or allowed, and each constraint is told, checked or\n  enforced. They apply at one workflow step, or at every step.'''),\n])\ns=open('DECISIONS.md').read()\ni=s.index('| D52 |'); j=s.index('\\n',i)+1\ns=s[:j]+'''| D53 | A step's rules live with the step, on the Workflows page, in one tab by layer: the charter (read-only, from the repository), the harness (grants, and the rules and hooks on calls), and the factory (review checks and reviewers). With no step picked, the page shows what applies at every step. Each rung is a switch. There is no Constraints or Capabilities page. |\n'''+s[j:]\nopen('DECISIONS.md','w').write(s)\nEOF\npython3 ~/.claude/skills/voice-check/voicecheck.py VISION.md 2>&1 | head -8","description":"Update VISION and add D53"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":524,"cache_read_input_tokens":688721,"output_tokens":855,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":524,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":855,"cache_read_input_tokens":688721,"cache_creation_input_tokens":524,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":524},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01D5QAzCZRi77eHqzWwowAK5":{"command":"cd /Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion && python3 - <<'EOF'\ndef edit(p, pairs):\n    s=open(p).read()\n    for old,new in pairs:\n        assert s.count(old)==1, (p, old[:70])\n        s=s.replace(old,new)\n    open(p,'w').write(s)\nedit('VISION.md',[\n('''**Rules, one server at a time.** Workflows, Constraints, Capabilities,\nEngine and Settings belong to the server you pick. A rules page never mixes\ntwo servers, because each server's rules shape only its own jobs, and a sum\nof two rule sets means nothing.''','''**Rules, one server at a time.** Workflows, Engine and Settings belong to\nthe server you pick. A step's rules live on the Workflows page, with the\nstep, and what applies at every step shows there when no step is picked. A\nrules page never mixes two servers, because each server's rules shape only\nits own jobs, and a sum of two rule sets means nothing.'''),\n('''- **Capabilities and constraints:** what an agent may call, each grant ask\n  or allowed, and the rules its work must keep, each from told to enforced.\n  Both apply to every step of a kind, or to one workflow step.''','''- **Rules, by layer:** the charter each workspace's repository brings; the\n  harness, what an agent may call and the rules and hooks on those calls;\n  and the factory, the checks on the work and the reviewers that must pass.\n  Each grant is ask or allowed, and each constraint is told, checked or\n  enforced. They apply at one workflow step, or at every step.'''),\n])\ns=open('DECISIONS.md').read()\ni=s.index('| D52 |'); j=s.index('\\n',i)+1\ns=s[:j]+'''| D53 | A step's rules live with the step, on the Workflows page, in one tab by layer: the charter (read-only, from the repository), the harness (grants, and the rules and hooks on calls), and the factory (review checks and reviewers). With no step picked, the page shows what applies at every step. Each rung is a switch. There is no Constraints or Capabilities page. |\n'''+s[j:]\nopen('DECISIONS.md','w').write(s)\nEOF\npython3 ~/.claude/skills/voice-check/voicecheck.py VISION.md 2>&1 | head -8","description":"Update VISION and add D53"}},"wireIngestContext":{"toolu_01D5QAzCZRi77eHqzWwowAK5":{"cwd":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"4f7ea813-97dd-4ab8-98cf-9bae8b53340f","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgyKob1psYyEzGjTqhEJC","type":"assistant","uuid":"a226ae93-0635-499c-94d7-33868949e1e7","timestamp":"2026-11-12T16:09:50.831Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion","sessionId":"4fe51ecd-d6cc-423f-a39e-68f5e5b7e45e","version":"2.1.285","gitBranch":"main","slug":"parsed-tinkering-blum"}
